              "value": "You will receive a JSON object. - {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} \nRead only the provided input.\nExtract Order as Order and OrganizationId as Organization.\nOutput only a valid JSON object in the following format:\n{ \"OrderNumber\": \"<value>\", \"Organization\": \"<value>\" , \"Context\":<context> }\nIf either field is missing, return null for that field."
