          "code": "RESPOND_WITH_AVAILABILITY",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1772086550932",
          "id": "1771872091879",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771872091880_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You have two inputs:\n\n1. **Order Information**  : {{$context.$nodes.GETORDERINFO.$output.items}}\n\n   * Fields: `Line`, `Item`, `RequestedQuantity`\n   * Each order line contains a requested quantity of a specific item.\n2. **Onhand Availability** {{$context.$nodes.GETONHANDAVAILPERITEM.$output}}\n\n   * This data provides multiple subinventories where the item is available, along with the available onhand quantities.\n   * Each record can have multiple subinventory details for a given item, each with an `AvailableToTransactQuantity`.\n\n### Objective:\n\nFor each line in the Order list, match the item with available onhand stock and find the best subinventory to fulfill the requested quantity for that line.\n\n### Instructions:\n\n* For **each line** in the order list:\n\n  * Find the **item** and match it to the corresponding onhand availability.\n  * If multiple subinventories exist for the item, **distribute the requested quantity** across the subinventories in such a way that the full **RequestedQuantity** is fulfilled.\n  * Return the best subinventory that has sufficient onhand stock to fulfill the requested quantity.\n\n### Output Structure:\n\nFor each line, generate a record containing the following information in Json format in to suggestion variable:\n\n* **Order**: {{$context.$variables.OrderNumber}} \n* **Line**: Take this from ShipmentLine Attribute from corresponding Row. \n* **Item**: The item number for that line. - Item Attribute from corresponding Row. \n* **Subinventory**: The subinventory where the onhand is available.\n* **Locator**: The Locator where the onhand is available.\n* **Quantity**: The available onhand quantity from that subinventory that will fulfill the requested quantity for that line.\n\n* Ensure the **requested quantity** is completely fulfilled by summing the quantities from different subinventories (if needed).\n\nFor each subinventory used, ensure the available quantity is used efficiently to fulfill the line's requested quantity.\nThe output should be grouped by **Line**, where each line may have multiple subinventory records. \nIf each line has used multiple subinventories, show one record for different subinventory and locator combination by providing Quantity appropriately\n\n### Expected Output Example:  Stick to this json format Mandatory\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Output\": [\n    {\n      \"Order\": \"SO5247\",\n      \"Line\": 1,\n      \"Item\": \"663913\",\n      \"Subinventory\": \"Stores\",\n      \"Quantity\": 2500,\n      \"Locator\":\"ABC\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"Order\": \"SO5247\",\n      \"Line\": 1,\n      \"Item\": \"663913\",\n      \"Subinventory\": \"XGON_91M1\",\n      \"Quantity\": 500,\n      \"Locator\":\"ABC\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"Order\": \"SO5247\",\n      \"Line\": 2,\n      \"Item\": \"663914\",\n      \"Subinventory\": \"KAM-SUB1\",\n      \"Quantity\": 1000,\n      \"Locator\":\"ABC\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"Order\": \"SO5247\",\n      \"Line\": 2,\n      \"Item\": \"663914\",\n      \"Subinventory\": \"Stores\",\n      \"Quantity\": 500,\n      \"Locator\":\"ABC\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Steps to Fulfill:\n\n1. **Match Item**: For each order line, identify the item from the order details and look for its corresponding onhand stock.\n2. **Distribute Quantity**: If there is more than one subinventory with onhand stock for an item, distribute the requested quantity across the subinventories based on available quantities.\n3. **Output Format**: For each line, include the subinventory,locator, item, and quantity (amount of stock taken from each subinventory), ensuring that the requested quantity is met.\n\nIf you are able to provide the snapshot for all lines then ensure to show the action as below\n\nAction Details:\n<oraInsight>\n{ \n \"title\": \"Quick Ship\", \n  \"shortDescription\": \"Initiate Quick Ship process for the Order.\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Perform Quick Ship\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": \"ora.Agent({\"command\": \"quickShip\",\"agent\" : \"INV_WH_OPS_OUTBOUND_ADVISOR\",\"suggestion\": <suggestion>})\"\n}\n</oraInsight>"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"Output\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
