              "value": " {{$context.$nodes.CURATESUBITEMSDATA.$output.result}} \nThis is list of Json where each json has\nres: as true or false - Indicated if Item has substitutes or not.\nif it s true - subItemsCuratedList has its corresponding substitutes.\n\nDisplay the substitute Items available with column name as Original Item (Item field of Json ),Substitute Item (this is a list. show this as child table ), Quantity , UOM and Subinventory Details as Subinventory in a table\nGive a small explanation here at the end ,-**Review if you can choose to use the substitute Items mentioned.** "
